WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.276 --> 00:00:03.526
(Spanish guitar music)

00:00:05.239 --> 00:00:08.572
(intense hip hop music)

00:00:17.586 --> 00:00:19.089
- [Man] I bought my office crush a rose

00:00:19.089 --> 00:00:21.157
not knowing she had two weeks off work.

00:00:21.157 --> 00:00:22.733
I left it in my locker
and it looked good enough

00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:24.567
to give her when she came back.

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:26.631
The head fell off as I handed it to her.

00:00:26.631 --> 00:00:27.881
- [Crowd] Awww!

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.582
- [Woman] I got food
poisoning from a burrito bowl

00:00:31.582 --> 00:00:33.283
at my boyfriend's house.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:35.303
Then his heat went out and it
was one of the coldest days

00:00:35.303 --> 00:00:36.708
of the year.

00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:38.483
I had to wear my winter coat in his bed

00:00:38.483 --> 00:00:40.417
covered in three blankets while trying not

00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:42.302
to (bleep) my pants.

00:00:42.302 --> 00:00:45.219
At least he was very nice about it.

00:00:46.571 --> 00:00:48.452
- [Man] In high school we used
to give each other carnations

00:00:48.452 --> 00:00:50.367
as Valentines.

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:52.358
Every one in our school
got flowers from friends,

00:00:52.358 --> 00:00:53.827
very special someone's,

00:00:53.827 --> 00:00:55.499
except for me.

00:00:55.499 --> 00:00:58.416
Four years and not a single flower.

00:01:00.704 --> 00:01:01.807
- [Woman] Last Valentine's day,

00:01:01.807 --> 00:01:04.487
my long distance boyfriend
and I got into a fight.

00:01:04.487 --> 00:01:06.921
I tried to say sorry by sending
him a heart-shaped pizza

00:01:06.921 --> 00:01:08.399
from Pizza Hut.

00:01:08.399 --> 00:01:10.083
And 30 minutes later I got a call saying

00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:12.366
(buzzing)
he refused the delivery.

00:01:12.366 --> 00:01:14.409
When she asked what I
wanted to do with it,

00:01:14.409 --> 00:01:17.742
I started crying and told her to eat it.

00:01:18.966 --> 00:01:20.383
- [Woman] My long distance
internet boyfriend

00:01:20.383 --> 00:01:22.899
of several years surprised
me at my college dorm

00:01:22.899 --> 00:01:24.725
on February 13th.

00:01:24.725 --> 00:01:27.046
It was the first time we met in person.

00:01:27.046 --> 00:01:29.135
But when I invited him to stay the night,

00:01:29.135 --> 00:01:30.951
he revealed he was just
stopping through Illinois

00:01:30.951 --> 00:01:32.536
on his way to New York

00:01:32.536 --> 00:01:33.955
where he was moving to live with his

00:01:33.955 --> 00:01:36.788
actual girlfriend.
- [Crowd] Awwww!

00:01:38.139 --> 00:01:40.786
- [Man] I had to go for a
colonoscopy on Valentine's day.

00:01:40.786 --> 00:01:42.836
Romantic as (bleep).

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:45.503
(hip hop music)

